{
  "_comentario": [
    "BORRADOR de aportación a OBDb (https://github.com/OBDb) para el Opel/Vauxhall",
    "Corsa C 1.7 DI, motor Y17DTL (2003). NO es un fichero del proyecto: es una",
    "propuesta pendiente de confirmar con ellos, porque este coche es PRE-CAN y su",
    "esquema usa identificadores CAN en 'hdr'/'rax'.",
    "",
    "Aquí 'hdr' es la cabecera KWP2000 por K-line (formato+destino+origen) y 'rax'",
    "la de la respuesta. El servicio es 21 (ReadDataByLocalIdentifier), igual que",
    "usa el Toyota-4Runner en su repo, con identificador local 01.",
    "",
    "Los 'bix' son el desplazamiento en bits dentro del bloque de 68 bytes que",
    "devuelve la ECU (bix = offset_en_bytes * 8). Todos los valores se han obtenido",
    "por ingeniería inversa contra el coche real y validado con ~2900 muestras.",
    "Detalle y evidencia: docs/mapa-21-01.md del repo corsa-ecu-analysis."
  ],
  "commands": [
    {
      "hdr": "8111F1",
      "rax": "93F111",
      "proto": "ISO14230-4-KWP-fastinit",
      "cmd": { "21": "01" },
      "freq": 2,
      "signals": [
        {
          "id": "CORSAC_RPM",
          "path": "Engine",
          "fmt": { "bix": 264, "len": 16, "max": 6000, "div": 8, "unit": "revolutionsPerMinute" },
          "name": "Engine speed",
          "suggestedMetric": "engineSpeed"
        },
        {
          "id": "CORSAC_ECT",
          "path": "Engine",
          "fmt": { "bix": 328, "len": 8, "min": 0, "max": 127, "div": 2, "unit": "celsius" },
          "name": "Engine coolant temperature",
          "suggestedMetric": "engineCoolantTemperature"
        },
        {
          "id": "CORSAC_ECT_TARGET",
          "path": "Engine",
          "fmt": { "bix": 304, "len": 8, "min": -40, "max": 215, "add": -40, "unit": "celsius" },
          "name": "Coolant thermostat setpoint (constant ~88 C, not a sensor)"
        },
        {
          "id": "CORSAC_ECT_RAW",
          "path": "Engine",
          "fmt": { "bix": 320, "len": 8, "max": 255 },
          "name": "Coolant sensor raw NTC reading (inverse scale)"
        },
        {
          "id": "CORSAC_IAT_RAW",
          "path": "Engine",
          "fmt": { "bix": 336, "len": 8, "max": 255 },
          "name": "Intake air temperature, raw NTC reading (inverse scale; not yet linearised)"
        },
        {
          "id": "CORSAC_MAP",
          "path": "Engine",
          "fmt": { "bix": 400, "len": 8, "max": 255, "unit": "kilopascal" },
          "name": "Manifold absolute pressure (turbo boost)",
          "suggestedMetric": "manifoldPressure"
        },
        {
          "id": "CORSAC_BATT",
          "path": "Electrical",
          "fmt": { "bix": 240, "len": 8, "max": 20, "mul": 234, "div": 1000, "unit": "volts" },
          "name": "Battery voltage as measured by the ECU",
          "suggestedMetric": "batteryVoltage"
        },
        {
          "id": "CORSAC_PEDAL",
          "path": "Engine",
          "fmt": { "bix": 440, "len": 8, "max": 100, "mul": 100, "div": 255, "unit": "percent" },
          "name": "Accelerator pedal position"
        },
        {
          "id": "CORSAC_PEDAL_T1",
          "path": "Engine",
          "fmt": { "bix": 416, "len": 8, "max": 255 },
          "name": "Accelerator pedal, track 1 (redundant sensor)"
        },
        {
          "id": "CORSAC_PEDAL_T2",
          "path": "Engine",
          "fmt": { "bix": 424, "len": 8, "max": 255 },
          "name": "Accelerator pedal, track 2 (redundant sensor, ~track1/2)"
        },
        {
          "id": "CORSAC_BRAKE",
          "path": "Movement",
          "fmt": { "bix": 227, "len": 1 },
          "name": "Brake pedal switch (dual contact: bits 3 and 4 must agree)"
        },
        {
          "id": "CORSAC_CLUTCH",
          "path": "Movement",
          "fmt": { "bix": 229, "len": 1 },
          "name": "Clutch pedal switch"
        },
        {
          "id": "CORSAC_AC_REQ",
          "path": "Climate",
          "fmt": { "bix": 189, "len": 1 },
          "name": "Air conditioning request"
        },
        {
          "id": "CORSAC_FULL_LOAD",
          "path": "Engine",
          "fmt": { "bix": 208, "len": 1 },
          "name": "Full load flag (software threshold, pedal >95%)"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "_notas": [
    "NO EXISTE canal de velocidad del vehículo: la ECU del motor no la recibe",
    "(coche sin ABS; la señal va solo al cuadro). Verificado conduciendo 0-120 km/h.",
    "El coche NO mide temperatura de aceite (solo tiene testigo de presión).",
    "Otros identificadores que responden al servicio 21: 90 (VIN) y A5-A9, B1, B3",
    "(registros de 2 bytes sin identificar).",
    "Averías: servicio 18 00 FF 00 (ReadDiagnosticTroubleCodesByStatus); usa códigos",
    "P estándar SAE J2012 (confirmado con el P0251 de la bomba inyectora)."
  ]
}
